{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08235","headline":"赠范金卿二首 二 · 李白","name":"赠范金卿二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"范宰不买名，弦歌对前楹。\n爲邦默自化，日觉冰壶清。\n百里鸡犬静，千庐机杼鸣。\n浮人少荡析，爱客多逢迎。\n游子覩嘉政，因之听颂声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08235.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08235","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}